# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Generated site data — every build writes here (slates, fantasy, NBA,
# Polymarket, UFC) and `ledger.export_json` writes record.json, which is
# the operator's own betting journal and bankroll. All of it regenerates
# from the build scripts, none of it belongs on the remote. Ignoring the
# directory (not a file list) so a NEW build target can't silently start
# tracking output again.
web/data/

# Downloaded / cached data feeds
data/cache/

# Trained models (regenerate with: python3 train_model.py)
data/models/

# Local API keys — never commit these
# Every shape of the secrets file, not just the exact name. An editor's
# backup holds the same keys as the original: nano writes secrets.local.save
# on an interrupted edit, vim writes .swp and ~, and a hand-made copy is
# usually secrets.local.bak. One of those sat untracked-but-visible in this
# repo with two live API keys in it, one `git add -A` from a public push.
secrets.local
secrets.local.*
secrets.local~
*.local.save

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Historical database (populate with: python3 ingest.py)
data/history.db
*.db
data/ledger.db
data/backups/
# Both forms on purpose. A trailing slash matches DIRECTORIES ONLY, and a
# symlink is not a directory to git — so `node_modules/` alone let a symlink
# named node_modules be committed, pointing at a scratchpad path that exists
# on no other machine. That broke `git pull` for everyone else with
# "Updating the following directories would lose untracked files".
node_modules
node_modules/

# Node is only ever used by tools/inventory.mjs, which resolves Playwright
# from a scratchpad symlink. A package.json in the repo root is a leftover of
# an npm run in the wrong directory, not a dependency of this project.
package.json
package-lock.json

# Generated UFC reference data — ufc_dossiers.py and the card/gym scrapers
# write these beside the DBs. Same rule as every other data/ artifact: the
# build regenerates them, so they never belong in the repo.
data/ufc_cards.json
data/ufc_dossiers.json
data/ufc_gyms.json

# Nightly runner: local logs and its overlap lock.
logs/
.nightly.lock
